[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m      \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    - Next, \( x = 27 \):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m      \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m      2(27) = 54 \equiv 54 - 9 \times 6 = 54 - 54 = 0 \pmod{6} \neq 5
