[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    The arithmetic mean of a set of numbers is the sum of the numbers divided by the count of the numbers. So, for four numbers, the formula is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \text{Arithmetic Mean} = \frac{7 + 2 + x + 10}{4} = 9
