[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 4. **Combine Like Terms in the Numerator**:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \[
