[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    n \equiv 21 - 24 = -3 \pmod{8}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    n \equiv 5 \pmod{8}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    So, \( n = 8k + 5 \) for some integer \( k \).
