[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m output:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m To determine the number of ways to form a subcommittee of 5 members with at least one member from each party (Republicans and Democrats), follow these steps:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 1. **Total Members**:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    - Republicans: 8
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    - Democrats: 6
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    - Total: 8 + 6 = 14 members.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 2. **Objective**:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    - We want to form a subcommittee of 5 members with at least one Republican and at least one Democrat.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 3. **Total Ways to Choose 5 Members from 14**:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \binom{14}{5} = \frac{14!}{5!(14-5)!} = \frac{14!}{5! \cdot 9!} = 2002
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 4. **Unfavorable Scenarios**:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    - We need to subtract the cases where the subcommittee is all Republicans or all Democrats.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    - **All Republicans**:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m      \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m      \binom{8}{5} = \frac{8!}{5!(8-5)!} = \frac{8!}{5! \cdot 3!} = 56
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m      \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    - **All Democrats**:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m      \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m      \binom{6}{5} = \frac{6!}{5!(6-5)!} = \frac{6!}{5! \cdot 1!} = 6
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m      \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 5. **Applying the Subtraction Principle**:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    - Number of subcommittees with at least one Republican and one Democrat:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \text{Total ways} - \text{All Republicans} - \text{All Democrats} = 2002 - 56 - 6 = 1940
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \]
