[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    Thus, each bag ends up with 32 coins, and:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    7(29) + 53 = 203 + 53 = 256
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m Hence, the smallest total initial coins is \(\boxed{1502}\).
