[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m To determine the number of ways to form a subcommittee of 5 members with at least one member from each party (Republican and Democrat), we can follow these steps:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 1. **Identify the Total Number of Members**:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    - Republicans: 8
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    - Democrats: 6
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    - **Total members**: 8 + 6 = 14
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 2. **Total Number of Ways to Choose Any 5 Members from 14**:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    The number of ways to choose 5 members out of 14 is given by the combination formula \( C(n, k) = \frac{n!}{k!(n-k)!} \):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \[
