[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    - **Case 1: Subcommittee with Only Republicans**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m      Number of ways to choose 5 Republicans out of 8:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m      \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m      C(8, 5) = \frac{8!}{5!(8-5)!} = \frac{8!}{5! \cdot 3!} = 56
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m      \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 
