[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 4. **Calculate the Number of Favorable Subcommittees**:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    Using the subtraction principle:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \[
