[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    - One bag is found to contain 53 coins.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    - We redistribute all the coins so that each of the eight bags contains the same number of coins.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    - After redistribution, each bag will have the same number of coins, and the total number of coins is more than 200.
