[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 3. **Redistribution Process**:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    - We redistribute the coins so that all eight bags have the same number of coins. Let’s denote the equal number of coins in each bag after redistribution as \( y \).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    So, we have:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \[
