[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    - Let \( n \) be the number of coins in each of the original seven bags.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    - We find an additional bag containing 53 coins.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 2. **Redistribute the Coins:**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    - We have a total of:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m      \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m      \text{Total coins} = 7n + 53
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m      \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    - After redistribution, we want all eight bags to have the same number of coins. Let \( k \) be the number of coins each bag will have after redistribution. Therefore, the total number of coins becomes:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m      \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m      8k
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m      \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    - Equating the two expressions gives:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m      \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m      7n + 53 = 8k
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m      \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    - We know that \( k \) must be an integer, so \( 7n + 53 \) must be a multiple of 8.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 3. **Set Up the Equation and Solve for \( n \):**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    7n + 53 \equiv 0 \pmod{8}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    Simplify the equation modulo 8:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    7n + 53 \equiv 0 \pmod{8}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    Since \( 7 \equiv -1 \pmod{8} \), we can substitute:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    -n + 53 \equiv 0 \pmod{8}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    Simplify further:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \[
