[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    - The total number of ways to choose any 5 members out of 14 is given by the combination formula \( C(n, k) = \frac{n!}{k!(n-k)!} \), where \( n \) is the total number of members and \( k \) is the number of members to choose.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 
