[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m      \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m      \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m      m > 4.092857...
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m      \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m      So, the smallest integer \( m \) satisfying this is \( m = 5 \).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 9. **Substitute \( m = 5 \) into \( n \):**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    n = 56(5) - 29
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \]
