[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 11. **Verify the Solution:**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m     - Total coins after adding the additional bag:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m     \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m     T = N + 53 = 1757 + 53 = 1810
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m     \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m     - Check redistribution into eight bags:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m     \[
