[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m     \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m     This calculation isn't an integer, so there was a mistake in the assumption that \( n = 251 \) leads to the correct solution.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 
