[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m To find the number of ways to form a subcommittee of 5 members with at least one member from each party (Republicans and Democrats), we can use the principle of complementary counting. Here's the step-by-step solution:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 
