[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    - **All Republicans**:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m      Number of ways to choose 5 Republicans out of 8:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m      \[
