[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m      \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    - **All Democrats**:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m      Number of ways to choose 5 Democrats out of 6:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m      \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m      \binom{6}{5} = \frac{6!}{5!(6-5)!} = \frac{6}{1} = 6
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m      \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 4. **Subtract the Unwanted Cases**:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    - Using complementary counting, we must exclude the cases where the subcommittee is entirely made up of Republicans or entirely of Democrats. Thus, we calculate the number of invalid cases where the subcommittee is either all Republicans or all Democrats.
