[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 5. **Using Complementary Counting**:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    To find the number of subcommittees with at least one member from each party, subtract the number of invalid subcommittees (all Republicans or all Democrats) from the total number of subcommittees we can choose from.
