[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m      56k + 35 + 53 > 200
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m      \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m      \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m      56k + 88 > 200
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m      \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    - Subtract 88 from both sides:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m      \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m      56k > 112
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m      \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    - Divide both sides by 56:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m      \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m      k > 2
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m      \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    - The smallest integer \( k \) that satisfies \( k > 2 \) is \( k = 3 \).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 6. **Substitute \( k = 3 \) to Find \( x \)**:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    x = 8(3) + 5
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    x = 24 + 5
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    x = 29
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 7. **Calculate the Total Number of Coins**:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    7x + 53 = 7(29) + 53
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    = 203 + 53
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    = 256
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 8. **Verify the Solution**:
