[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    To form a subcommittee consisting only of Republicans:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \[
