[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 2. **Recall the formula for the arithmetic mean**:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \text{Arithmetic Mean} = \frac{\text{Sum of all terms}}{\text{Number of terms}}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 3. **Plug in the known values**:
