[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m      \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m      Multiply both sides by -1:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m      \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m      x \equiv 5 \pmod{8}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m      \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    - This means:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m      \[
