[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m A Senate committee has 8 Republicans and 6 Democrats.  In how many ways can we form a subcommittee of 5 members that has at least one member from each party?
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{}.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m assistant
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m output:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m To determine the number of ways to form a subcommittee of 5 members with at least one member from each party (Republicans and Democrats), we can follow these steps:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 1. **Identify the Parties**:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    - Republicans: 8 members
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    - Democrats: 6 members
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 2. **Total Members in the Senate Committee**:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    - Total members = 8 Republicans + 6 Democrats = 14 members
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 3. **Objective**:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    - We want to form a subcommittee of 5 members with **at least one** member from each party (i.e., both Republicans and Democrats).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 4. **Approach**:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    To find the number of valid subcommittees, we can use the **inclusion-exclusion principle** or by directly calculating the combinations with the condition applied.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m Here, we'll use the **direct calculation method**:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m - **Total number of ways to choose any 5 members out of 14**:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m   \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m   \text{Total ways} = \binom{14}{5}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m   \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m - **Subtract the cases that don't satisfy the condition (i.e., all members are from only one party)**:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m   - **All members are Republicans**:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m     \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m     \text{Ways to choose 5 Republicans out of 8} = \binom{8}{5}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m     \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m   
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m   - **All members are Democrats**:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m     \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m     \text{Ways to choose 5 Democrats out of 6} = \binom{6}{5}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m     \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m - **Apply inclusion-exclusion principle**:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m   \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m   \text{Number of valid subcommittees} = \binom{14}{5} - \binom{8}{5} - \binom{6}{5}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m   \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 5. **Calculate each component**:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    - \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \binom{14}{5} = \frac{14!}{5!(14-5)!} = \frac{14 \times 13 \times 12 \times 11 \times 10}{5 \times 4 \times 3 \times 2 \times 1} = 2002
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    - \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \binom{8}{5} = \frac{8!}{5!(8-5)!} = \frac{8 \times 7 \times 6 \times 5 \times 4}{5 \times 4 \times 3 \times 2 \times 1} = 56
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    - \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \binom{6}{5} = \frac{6!}{5!(6-5)!} = \frac{6 \times 5!}{5! \times 1!} = 6
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 6. **Plug the values back into the formula**:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \text{Number of valid subcommittees} = 2002 - 56 - 6 = 1940
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 
