[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m      \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    - **Case 2: All 5 members are Democrats**:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m      We choose 5 Democrats out of 6:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m      \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m      \binom{6}{5} = \frac{6!}{5!(6-5)!} = 6
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m      \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 4. **Total Invalid Cases**:
