[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \binom{8}{5} + \binom{6}{5} = 56 + 6 = 62
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 
