[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \text{Number of valid subcommittees} = \binom{14}{5} - \left( \binom{8}{5} + \binom{6}{5} \right) = 2002 - 62 = 1940
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m Thus, the number of ways to form a subcommittee of 5 members with at least one member from each party is \(\boxed{1940}\).
