[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m To find the smallest number of coins before the bag of 53 coins, follow these steps:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 1. **Understand the Problem**:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    - You have seven bags with an equal number of coins each.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    - You find one additional bag with 53 coins.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    - You redistribute all coins so that all eight bags have the same number of coins.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    - After redistribution, each bag has the same number of coins, and you have more than 200 coins initially.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 2. **Let \( n \) be the number of coins in each of the original seven bags**:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    - Total initial coins before adding the extra bag:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    7n
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    - After adding the 53 coins from the new bag:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \text{Total coins now} = 7n + 53
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 3. **Redistribution**:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    - You want to distribute these coins into 8 bags equally. So, each bag will have:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \frac{7n + 53}{8} \text{ coins}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    - This fraction must be an integer, so:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    7n + 53 \equiv 0 \pmod{8}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m 4. **Simplify the Congruence Equation**:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    7n + 53 \equiv 0 \pmod{8}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    - Reduce the constants modulo 8:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88790)[0m    7 \equiv -1 \pmod{8} \text{ and } 53 \div 8 = 6 \text{ with a remainder of } 53 - 8 \times 6 = 53 - 48 = 5
